    prompt_en:
      "Discuss in ten or more sentences the claim that suburban sprawl promised convenience but ultimately deepened social isolation. Use '-을 넘어서다' (to go beyond ~) and '-라 할지라도' (even if it be the case that ~) at least once each.",
