      "Discuss in ten or more sentences the view that the fact many celebrities' autobiographies and memoirs are actually completed by professional ghostwriters is nothing other than rendering the very concept of authorship meaningless. Use '-에 다름 아니다' (is nothing other than ~) and '-을 계기로' (taking ~ as an occasion) at least once each.",
