      "Discuss in ten or more sentences the criticism that space tourism is being pursued in spite of the risk, opening a new frontier for humanity, yet its environmental cost is too great a price to pay for the experience of a few. Use '-을 무릅쓰고' (in spite of the risk of ~) and '-에 지나지 않는다' (is nothing but ~) at least once each.",
