    prompt_en:
      "Discuss in ten or more sentences the claim that the value of authenticity attributed to handcrafted goods is nothing other than an illusion created by nostalgia for a pre-mass-production age. Use '-에 다름 아니다' (is nothing other than ~) and '-라 할지라도' (even if it be the case that ~) at least once each.",
