      "Discuss in ten or more sentences whether historical reenactments of war and historical events can be taken as an occasion for educational learning about the past, or whether they have reached the point of consuming suffering as entertainment. Use '-을 계기로' (taking ~ as an occasion) and '-기에 이르렀다' (has reached the point of ~) at least once each.",
